@startuml 23-state-privilege-request
title PrivilegeRequest lifecycle
[*] --> PENDING : request()
PENDING --> ACTIVE : approve()\n[approver ≠ requester,\npermanent admin]
PENDING --> REJECTED : reject(reason)
PENDING --> CANCELLED : cancel() by requester\nor account change
ACTIVE --> EXPIRED : now ≥ expires_at\n(expire_due sweep)
ACTIVE --> REVOKED : revoke() by admin\nor account disabled / role changed
REJECTED --> [*]
CANCELLED --> [*]
EXPIRED --> [*]
REVOKED --> [*]
@enduml
